{
  "_about": [
    "One entry per data field. Every tool reads this file: extract.py (build -> data),",
    "build.py (data -> build), lint.py (legal values), job.py (brief scaffolding).",
    "Add a dial here and it exists everywhere. Nothing else lists dials.",
    "",
    "scope    brand | global",
    "const    the JS const the build emits",
    "path     dotted path inside a brand record (brand scope only)",
    "type     int | str | url | list | obj | bool | prices | doors | onething | fibre",
    "range    [lo, hi] for ints",
    "banned   int values that must never reappear (retired bands)",
    "absent   what a missing value means: not_assessed | not_represented | required",
    "         'required' = every brand must carry it; a GAP if missing",
    "         'not_assessed' = the build emits nothing and the UI reads the 99 sentinel",
    "         'not_represented' = the UI reads 0. A dial where 0 means 'no' and absence means 'no'",
    "         are different things and the doc string says which; see the 1,491-cell migration",
    "note     a NOTES key exists for this dial",
    "const null = data-only: kept in the record, checked by lint, never emitted into the page"
  ],
